<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Acceso Vencido - PTM</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/bootstrap/5.3.3/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
  :root{
    --ptm-bg-1:#081c2e;
    --ptm-bg-2:#0a2540;
    --ptm-blue-light:#29a0de;
    --ptm-blue-mid:#1877c4;
    --ptm-blue-dark:#0a5fa0;
    --ptm-steel-light:#a9c3d8;
    --ptm-line:rgba(41,160,222,0.18);
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}

  body{
    margin:0;
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(41,160,222,0.10), transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%, rgba(24,119,196,0.14), transparent 45%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--ptm-bg-1), var(--ptm-bg-2));
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    color:#dfe3e8;
    padding:24px;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }

  /* Textura tipo "placa industrial" */
  body::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background-image:
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 3px);
    pointer-events:none;
  }

  .card-panel{
    position:relative;
    width:100%;
    max-width:460px;
    background:linear-gradient(155deg, #1a2029 0%, #12161d 100%);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border-radius:6px;
    padding:44px 38px 34px;
    box-shadow:
      0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  }

  /* Esquinas tipo remaches */
  .rivet{
    position:absolute;
    width:6px; height:6px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%, #6b7280, #2a2f38);
    box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
  }
  .rivet.tl{top:14px;left:14px;}
  .rivet.tr{top:14px;right:14px;}
  .rivet.bl{bottom:14px;left:14px;}
  .rivet.br{bottom:14px;right:14px;}

  .status-strip{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ptm-blue-light);
    font-weight:600;
    margin-bottom:28px;
  }
  .status-strip .dot{
    width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--ptm-blue-light);
    box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(41,160,222,0.6);
    animation:pulse 2s infinite;
  }
  @@keyframes pulse{
    0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(41,160,222,0.45);}
    70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(41,160,222,0);}
    100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(41,160,222,0);}
  }

  .logo-wrap{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }
  .logo-wrap img{
    height:38px;
    width:auto;
  }

  .icon-lock{
    width:64px;height:64px;
    border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    background:linear-gradient(155deg, #142a42, #0a1c2e);
    border:1px solid var(--ptm-line);
    margin-bottom:22px;
    font-size:26px;
    color:var(--ptm-blue-light);
  }

  h1.title{
    font-size:1.5rem;
    font-weight:700;
    color:#f0f2f5;
    margin-bottom:8px;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }

  p.subtitle{
    color:var(--ptm-steel-light);
    font-size:0.94rem;
    line-height:1.55;
    margin-bottom:26px;
  }

  .divider-line{
    height:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--ptm-line), transparent);
    margin:0 0 24px;
  }

  .footer-tag{
    text-align:center;
    font-size:0.7rem;
    color:#4a5f75;
    letter-spacing:.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-top:30px;
  }

  @@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .status-strip .dot{animation:none;}
  }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card-panel">
        <div class="rivet tl"></div>
        <div class="rivet tr"></div>
        <div class="rivet bl"></div>
        <div class="rivet br"></div>

        <div class="logo-wrap">
            <img src="LogoPTM.png" alt="PTM">
        </div>

        <div class="status-strip">
            <span class="dot"></span>
            Sesión bloqueada
        </div>

        <div class="icon-lock">
            <i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill"></i>
        </div>

        <h1 class="title">Tu acceso ha vencido</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
            Tu cuenta ya no tiene permisos activos para ingresar al Sistema Integral de Mantenimientos PTM.
        </p>

        <div class="footer-tag">PTM · Sistema Integral de Mantenimientos</div>
    </div>

    <script>
  // Espacio disponible si luego quieres inyectar datos con Razor (@@User.Identity.Name, fecha, etc.)
    </script>

</body>
</html>